   */
  skillNames?: string,
}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools.figma.get_comments","description":"Get comments on a Figma file. Supports Figma Design (`/design/`), FigJam (`/board/`), Figma Slides (`/slides/`), and Figma Make (`/make/`) files. Other file types are unsupported by `get_comments`. To read comments on a Figma Specs file (`/spec/`), read the `figma-spec` skill and use `use_figma`. If the URL is of the format https://figma.com/design/:fileKey/branch/:branchKey/:fileName then use the branchKey as the fileKey.","signature":"tools.figma.get_comments({
  /**
   * After create_session succeeds, pass its exact returned UUID here on every file-tool call for this task, even when fileKey differs.
   * @format uuid @pattern ^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$
